msgid "Key Parameter Descriptions:"
msgstr "关键参数说明："

msgid ""
"Only the key parameters specific to this model/scenario are described below."
" max-model-len and max-num-seqs need to be set according to the actual usage"
" scenario."
msgstr "下面仅描述该模型/场景特有的关键参数。max-model-len 和 max-num-seqs 需要根据实际使用场景进行设置。"

msgid "**Multi-node network and data parallel configuration:**"
msgstr "**多节点网络和数据并行配置：**"

msgid ""
"- `HCCL_IF_IP`, `GLOO_SOCKET_IFNAME`, `TP_SOCKET_IFNAME`, `HCCL_SOCKET_IFNAME`: Network interface configuration for multi-node communication. Set `nic_name` to the network interface name (obtained via `ifconfig`) and `local_ip` to the current node's IP address. These must be correctly configured on each node for successful multi-node communication.\n"
"- `--data-parallel-size 8`: Total number of data parallel ranks across all nodes (4 ranks per node in this scenario).\n"
"- `--data-parallel-size-local 4`: Number of data parallel ranks on the current node.\n"
"- `--data-parallel-start-rank`: Starting rank offset for data parallel ranks on this node. Node 0 uses `0`, node 1 uses `4`.\n"
"- `--data-parallel-address`: IP address of the data parallel master node (node 0). Must match the `local_ip` of the master node.\n"
"- `--data-parallel-rpc-port 12980`: RPC port for data parallel master communication. Must be the same across all nodes.\n"
"- `--headless`: Indicates a non-master node (used on node 1-3). Do not use on node 0."
msgstr ""
"- `HCCL_IF_IP`、`GLOO_SOCKET_IFNAME`、`TP_SOCKET_IFNAME`、`HCCL_SOCKET_IFNAME`：用于多节点通信的网络接口配置。将 `nic_name` 设置为网络接口名称（通过 `ifconfig` 获取），将 `local_ip` 设置为当前节点的 IP 地址。必须在每个节点上正确配置这些参数，才能实现成功的多节点通信。\n"
"- `--data-parallel-size 8`：所有节点上的数据并行 rank 总数（此场景中每个节点 4 个 rank）。\n"
"- `--data-parallel-size-local 4`：当前节点上的数据并行 rank 数量。\n"
"- `--data-parallel-start-rank`：当前节点上数据并行 rank 的起始偏移量。节点 0 使用 `0`，节点 1 使用 `4`。\n"
"- `--data-parallel-address`：数据并行主节点（节点 0）的 IP 地址。必须与主节点的 `local_ip` 一致。\n"
"- `--data-parallel-rpc-port 12980`：数据并行主节点通信的 RPC 端口。所有节点必须保持一致。\n"
"- `--headless`：表示非主节点（在节点 1-3 上使用）。不要在节点 0 上使用。"

msgid "**A2-specific environment variables:**"
msgstr "**A2 特有的环境变量：**"

msgid ""
"- `CPU_AFFINITY_CONF=1`: Enables CPU core affinity binding for worker processes.\n"
"- `ACL_OP_INIT_MODE=1`: ACL operator initialization mode to speed up operator compilation.\n"
"- `VLLM_RPC_TIMEOUT=360000` / `VLLM_EXECUTE_MODEL_TIMEOUT_SECONDS=3000` / `HCCL_EXEC_TIMEOUT=200` / `HCCL_CONNECT_TIMEOUT=120` / `VLLM_ENGINE_READY_TIMEOUT_S=1200`: Timeout settings for multi-node startup and model execution on the slower A2 platform. Increase them if the engine fails to become ready in time."
msgstr ""
"- `CPU_AFFINITY_CONF=1`：为工作进程启用CPU核心亲和性绑定。\n"
"- `ACL_OP_INIT_MODE=1`：ACL算子初始化模式，用于加速算子编译。\n"
"- `VLLM_RPC_TIMEOUT=360000` / `VLLM_EXECUTE_MODEL_TIMEOUT_SECONDS=3000` / `HCCL_EXEC_TIMEOUT=200` / `HCCL_CONNECT_TIMEOUT=120` / `VLLM_ENGINE_READY_TIMEOUT_S=1200`：在较慢的A2平台上进行多节点启动和模型执行的超时设置。如果引擎未能及时就绪，请增大这些值。"

msgid ""
"**Notice:**\n"
"This scenario enables `additional_config.enable_fused_mc2=1` (fused `dispatch_ffn_combine`/`mega_moe` operators). Fused MC2 conflicts with `multistream_overlap_shared_expert` — the two optimizations must not be enabled at the same time (the runtime forcibly disables `multistream_overlap_shared_expert` when fused MC2 is on)."
msgstr ""
"**注意：**\n"
"此场景启用了`additional_config.enable_fused_mc2=1`（融合的`dispatch_ffn_combine`/`mega_moe`算子）。融合MC2与`multistream_overlap_shared_expert`存在冲突——这两种优化不能同时启用（当融合MC2开启时，运行时将强制禁用`multistream_overlap_shared_expert`）。"

